title: Battlements
text: Every gap in the wall turns the beam left. Walk the wall the right way, and each tower gets its own flag.
trick: twisters at the foot of every gap turn the beam only left, so the wall has to be walked from left to right; the beam must first go the long way round to the far tower
motif: castle wall
expect: shared>=5
ink: 2.5
